{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the venerable art of Necromancy on the fly from your very own undead tutor!  Sure, it's a mean rotting skull on a stick that seems more interested in insulting you than helping you rescue the fair Lady Orla, but when it comes to interrogating graveyard ghosts and dabbling in the dark arts, options are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/52df6ce269053edc3b26405529fc5b55.poster.avif?t=1760975733\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/52df6ce269053edc3b26405529fc5b55.webm?t=1760975733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/52df6ce269053edc3b26405529fc5b55.mp4?t=1760975733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadow puppet aesthetic inspired by German Expressionism\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique deaths with in-game gallery/tracker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable player name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings with cg gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 fully voiced characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain of deals puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~4 hours playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 good boy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/e2318be81df28f56b06705ce9c0afb59.poster.avif?t=1760975733\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/e2318be81df28f56b06705ce9c0afb59.webm?t=1760975733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/extras/e2318be81df28f56b06705ce9c0afb59.mp4?t=1760975733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627580?t=1760975733","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/2ffcede457d40fc39f4cf83271719ec0a5eb24cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760975733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/6bcbf5a8b8b6747c8eaf7a5bf96e16e42bdeb867/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760975733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627580/6bcbf5a8b8b6747c8eaf7a5bf96e16e42bdeb867/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760975733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A bit of blood is involved in these necromantic rituals.  Also, depictions of ghosts discussing the way in which they died.  Descriptions of your character's death as well, if you're unlucky.  One of the spirits  seems to think he's working in a bar and says things to indicate that particular atmosphere. Infidelity is  talked about and  there is one slimy ghost who may flirt with the player character without consent.   \r\n"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3763890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the venerable art of Necromancy on the fly from your very own undead tutor!  Sure, it's a mean rotting skull on a stick that seems more interested in insulting you than helping you rescue the fair Lady Orla, but when it comes to interrogating gra